# Secrets / API keys / tokens / credentials MUST NEVER be committed.
# Keep them in environment variables, Windows Credential Manager,
# or a password manager outside the repo. Personal secret notes
# (e.g. ~/Downloads/*.txt, ~/*.secret, ~/*.key) belong outside the
# working tree; if you must keep a file inside the repo, use one of
# the patterns below.
*.pem
*.key
*.token
secrets/
